record evidence-intake-project.evidence.analyzer-suite/1 : evidence {
    title "77 tests pass, clippy clean under -D warnings, formatting clean. tests/suggest.rs adds 10: proposals entering only `suggested` and surfacing in the review queue as machine-generated with the analyzer named, a rerun proposing nothing, a rejected suggestion never returning, deferring to a human edge recorded in the opposite direction, overlaps proposed without any event changing lane, a before/after review-state snapshot proving nothing else was touched and the review trail stayed empty, rationales free of scoring language, the two content analyzers never claiming the same pair, case scoping, and an unknown case refused. Verified by hand on both fixtures: vehicle-stop proposes 3 and skips 1, a second run proposes 0, hit-and-run proposes 10."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:a3a8200bba2135119f04f4488e2ef941b5048aa6
    command "cargo fmt --check && cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings && cargo test --all-features"
    summary """
        77 tests pass, clippy clean under -D warnings, formatting clean. tests/suggest.rs adds 10: proposals entering only `suggested` and surfacing in the review queue as machine-generated with the analyzer named, a rerun proposing nothing, a rejected suggestion never returning, deferring to a human edge recorded in the opposite direction, overlaps proposed without any event changing lane, a before/after review-state snapshot proving nothing else was touched and the review trail stayed empty, rationales free of scoring language, the two content analyzers never claiming the same pair, case scoping, and an unknown case refused. Verified by hand on both fixtures: vehicle-stop proposes 3 and skips 1, a second run proposes 0, hit-and-run proposes 10.
        """
}

